      *01  VAPS-FIGURATIVE-CONSTANTS.                                           
         03  VAPS-FIGURATIVE-CONSTANTS.                                         
           05  HIGH-DATE           COMP-3.                                      
               10  HIGH-YEAR       VALUE +999      PIC S9(3).                   
               10  HIGH-DAY        VALUE +365      PIC S9(3).                   
           05  LOW-DATE            COMP-3.                                      
               10  LOW-YEAR        VALUE +000      PIC S9(3).                   
               10  LOW-DAY         VALUE +001      PIC S9(3).                   
      *                                                                         
           05  BINARY-CONSTANTS    COMP.                                        
               10  BIN-1           VALUE +1        PIC S9(4).                   
               10  BIN-2           VALUE +2        PIC S9(4).                   
               10  BIN-3           VALUE +3        PIC S9(4).                   
               10  BIN-4           VALUE +4        PIC S9(4).                   
