               10  BIN-8           VALUE +8        PIC S9(4).                   
               10  BIN-9           VALUE +9        PIC S9(4).                   
      *                                                                         
           05  PACKED-CONSTANTS    COMP-3.                                      
               10  PACK-1          VALUE +1        PIC S9.                      
               10  PACK-2          VALUE +2        PIC S9.                      
               10  PACK-3          VALUE +3        PIC S9.                      
               10  PACK-4          VALUE +4        PIC S9.                      
